   "text": "Consequence statement: \"This is a manual exception. It is logged with the order-book default and your reason. It stays in force\nthrough later order-book landings until you remove it. Once it is confirmed into the common plan, it appears on the monthly review\nagenda and raises an alert to Operations.\"",
