   "locked": false,
   "text": "States: empty — n/a (opens only when an edit changes a frozen share); loading — \"Saving…\"; error — \"Reason required\" inline; \"This planning model is outside your\nwrite scope\"; engine error with Retry; success — the share shows \"manual exception\" with an edit marker, and the cell keeps its snowflake.",
   "originalText": "States: empty — n/a (opens only when an edit changes a frozen share); loading — \"Saving…\"; error — \"Reason required\" inline; \"This planning model is outside your\nwrite scope\"; engine error with Retry; success — the share shows \"manual exception\" with an edit marker, and the cell keeps its snowflake.",
