   "text": "Server decides: the zone of each MK × plant pair (own length, own plant Working Days), the share split by request share, the order-book defaults, whether the edit\nchanges a frozen share, whether this user may except, the logging. If the zone list is empty (U4 not delivered), no share is frozen and this dialog never appears.",
